          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwyzppd1d5lo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Former US special envoy Mick Mulvaney stated regarding Trump's unification comments: 'This does not represent a shift in US foreign policy. We're still very much committed to the Good Friday Agreement.'",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cwyzppd1d5lo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Speaking alongside Irish Prime Minister Micheal Martin in Dublin, Donald Trump said: 'I don’t want to cause any problems but I’d love to see it unified. It’s going to happen eventually. It may as well happen now.'",
          "kind": "quote",
