          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/donald-trump-stirs-controversy-predicts-uk-run-ireland-eventually-i-d-love-to-see-it-unified-would-be-fantastic-11789234754964.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "British Prime Minister Andy Burnham stated weeks prior to Trump's visit that a referendum on Northern Ireland leaving the UK was 'off the table'.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/trump-says-he-would-love-see-united-ireland-6380186",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "DUP leader Gavin Robinson rejected Trump's remarks, stating that unification with Ireland would lead to 'the destruction of our country.'",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/trump-says-he-would-love-see-united-ireland-6380186",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Irish President Catherine Connolly stated she conveyed to Trump 'the strong view of the Irish people that the normalisation of war and genocide can never be accepted.'",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/trump-says-he-would-love-see-united-ireland-6380186",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "During his meeting with premier Micheal Martin, Donald Trump said: 'You took all our medical companies, we've got to get a couple of them back. You fleeced us but that's okay.'",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Channel News Asia",
          "url": "https://www.channelnewsasia.com/world/trump-says-he-would-love-see-united-ireland-6380186",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Reform UK leader Nigel Farage publicly disagreed with Donald Trump, stating that Northern Ireland is a 'proud and integral part of the United Kingdom'.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/northern-ireland-is-part-of-uk-nigel-farage-rejects-trumps-call-for-united-ireland/articleshow/134149044.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Donald Trump flew on Saturday afternoon to his resort in Doonbeg, County Clare, which was hosting the Irish Open.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/12/donald-trump-says-he-would-love-to-see-united-ireland",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Thousands of protesters marched through central Dublin and held a rally outside parliament to demonstrate against Trump's visit.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/sep/12/donald-trump-says-he-would-love-to-see-united-ireland",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
